        {
          "resource_id": "monster_action",
          "stats": {
            "action_name": {
              "value": "Steal Shadow"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "(divine, necromancy)\n\nThe shadow pulls at the target's shadow, making the creature enfeebled 1. This is cumulative with other enfeebled conditions from shadows, to a maximum of enfeebled 4. If this increases a creature's enfeebled value to 3 or more, the target's shadow is separated from its body (see shadow spawn). Enfeebled from Steal Shadow decreases by 1 every hour. This ability only functions against the PC who the shadow appears to duplicate."
            },
